                <div class="framer-1e374s0" data-framer-name="Text">
                  <div class="framer-46ixfy" data-framer-name="Grantiv is a digital-first platform designed to simplify and democratize access to grants." data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none">
                    <h5 dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-103ke8p" data-styles-preset="103ke8p" style="text-align:left;--framer-text-alignment:start">The Homepage Trap — Why General Pages Kill Paid ROAS</h5>
                    <p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-15ztfp1">
                      <br class="framer-text">Your homepage was built to serve everyone: investors, job seekers, existing customers, and casual browsers. When a prospect clicks a specific paid ad on Meta or TikTok and lands on a generic homepage with ten navigation links, their attention fractures. Instead of buying, they click around, get distracted, and bounce—burning half your ad budget before they ever see your offer.</p>
                      <h5 dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-103ke8p" data-styles-preset="103ke8p" style="text-align:left;--framer-text-alignment:start">Message Match: The 3-Second Rule of Cold Traffic</h5>
                      <p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-15ztfp1">
                        <br class="framer-text">When someone clicks an ad promising a specific solution, their brain looks for immediate visual and verbal confirmation on the next screen. If your ad hooks them on a specific pain point, your landing page headline must mirror that exact promise word-for-word in the first three seconds. Any cognitive disconnect between the ad creative and the page headline triggers instant distrust.</p>
                        <h5 dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-103ke8p" data-styles-preset="103ke8p" style="text-align:left;--framer-text-alignment:start">Killing the Navigation Bar to Lock In Focus</h5>
                        <p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-15ztfp1">
                          <br class="framer-text">Dedicated conversion landing pages strip away every escape hatch. No dropdown menus, no ‘About Us’ rabbit holes, and no competing calls-to-action. Every pixel is engineered around a single binary choice: claim the offer or leave. Removing navigation leaks alone routinely lifts paid traffic conversion rates by 35% to 60%.</p>
                          <h5 dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-103ke8p" data-styles-preset="103ke8p" style="text-align:left;--framer-text-alignment:start">Why Page Speed Is a Silent Media-Buying Tax</h5>
                          <p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-15ztfp1">
                            <br class="framer-text">Paid social traffic is overwhelmingly mobile and impatient. If your landing page takes four seconds to load heavy scripts, up to 40% of the clicks you already paid for abandon the page before the hero section even renders. That means you are paying Meta and TikTok full price for traffic that never even sees your headline.</p>
                          </div>
                          <div class="framer-n8vu8z" data-framer-name="Grantiv is a digital-first platform designed to simplify and democratize access to grants." data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none">
                            <h5 dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-103ke8p" data-styles-preset="103ke8p" style="text-align:left;--framer-text-alignment:start">UI on Framer, Frontend on Astro: Engineered for Sub-Second Scale</h5>
                            <p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-15ztfp1">
                              <br class="framer-text">At Enraux, we refuse to compromise between visual authority and raw speed. We architect the UI and interactive conversion flows in Framer so your brand looks like an undisputed category leader, then engineer the production frontend on Astro. The result is zero JavaScript bloat, instant mobile load times, and a frictionless path to checkout.</p>
                              <h5 dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-103ke8p" data-styles-preset="103ke8p" style="text-align:left;--framer-text-alignment:start">Structuring the Page Like a Top 1% Sales Closer</h5>
                              <p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-15ztfp1">
                                <br class="framer-text">A high-converting page follows a strict psychological sequence: an undeniable above-the-fold hook, agitation of the core bottleneck, a clear visual breakdown of your unique mechanism, quantified proof, and an asymmetric risk-reversal right beside the call-to-action. It anticipates and destroys every buyer objection in the exact order they arise.</p>
                                <h5 dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-103ke8p" data-styles-preset="103ke8p" style="text-align:left;--framer-text-alignment:start">The 7-Day Landing Page Sprint Blueprint</h5>
                                <p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-15ztfp1">
                                  <br class="framer-text">You do not need an eight-week agency redesign to fix a leaky funnel. You need one ruthless, conversion-engineered landing page built specifically for your paid traffic. We scope, write, design, and ship custom high-converting landing pages in rapid 7-day sprints—starting from $900—so you can stop bleeding ad spend immediately.</p>
                                  <h5 dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-103ke8p" data-styles-preset="103ke8p" style="text-align:left;--framer-text-alignment:start">What Happens When You Unify Ads and Pages</h5>
                                  <p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-15ztfp1">
                                    <br class="framer-text">When the same team scripting your 30 monthly static ads and 3 video ads also engineers the landing page those ads point to, your acquisition metrics compound. Lower bounce rates reward you with cheaper CPMs, higher click-to-close rates slash your CAC, and your ad account can finally scale spend profitably.</p>
                                    <h5 dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-103ke8p" data-styles-preset="103ke8p" style="text-align:left;--framer-text-alignment:start">The Enraux Protocol — Closing the Loop on Your Funnel</h5>
                                    <p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-15ztfp1">
                                      <br class="framer-text">Stop hiring separate ad agencies and web designers who blame each other when revenue stalls. At Enraux, we build the high-velocity ad creatives that win the click and the Astro-powered landing pages that close the sale. Launch your custom landing page sprint from $900, or start our 33-asset monthly Ad Creative Engine with just a $200 initiation deposit.</p>
                                    </div>
                                  </div>
                                </div>
                              </div>
