    <script type="framer/handover" id="__framer__handoverData">[{"0":1,"1":87},["Map",2,3,36,37],"{\"from\":\"5c432e6e-f7ab-4733-8a3b-ed15d8b1df6a\",\"select\":[{\"collection\":\"IuWZzi4EW\",\"name\":\"LkCClLDwu\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"IuWZzi4EW\",\"name\":\"zwjW3YJym\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"IuWZzi4EW\",\"name\":\"J9eZvgHrx\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"IuWZzi4EW\",\"name\":\"aQazb_xvt\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"IuWZzi4EW\",\"name\":\"urP_JSpgo\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"IuWZzi4EW\",\"name\":\"rtkeXSIIB\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"IuWZzi4EW\",\"name\":\"nMixSoL6n\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"IuWZzi4EW\",\"name\":\"M55uPww3d\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"IuWZzi4EW\",\"name\":\"neMUTKFo3\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"IuWZzi4EW\",\"name\":\"h24H5YGu_\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"}],\"where\":{\"type\":\"BinaryOperation\",\"operator\":\"==\",\"left\":{\"type\":\"TypeCast\",\"value\":{\"type\":\"Identifier\",\"name\":\"ff2p7S_0G\",\"collection\":\"IuWZzi4EW\"},\"dataType\":\"STRING\"},\"right\":{\"type\":\"LiteralValue\",\"value\":\"why-sending-paid-traffic-to-your-homepage-is-burning-half-your-ad-spend\"}}}default",[4],{"LkCClLDwu":5,"zwjW3YJym":8,"J9eZvgHrx":15,"aQazb_xvt":17,"urP_JSpgo":19,"rtkeXSIIB":24,"nMixSoL6n":27,"M55uPww3d":30,"neMUTKFo3":32,"h24H5YGu_":34},{"type":6,"value":7},"string","Why Sending Paid Traffic to Your Homepage Is Burning Half Your Ad Spend",{"type":9,"value":10},"responsiveimage",{"src":11,"srcSet":12,"pixelWidth":13,"pixelHeight":13,"alt":14},"https://framerusercontent.com/images/G2CvshF9W75F3Xva6ygeRIDjg.jpg?width=1024&height=1024","https://framerusercontent.com/images/G2CvshF9W75F3Xva6ygeRIDjg.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1024&height=1024 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/G2CvshF9W75F3Xva6ygeRIDjg.jpg?width=1024&height=1024 1024w",1024,"Image",{"type":6,"value":16},"Most brands blame Meta or TikTok when ROAS drops—when the real leak is the disconnect between the ad hook and the landing page.",{"type":6,"value":18},"4 Min",{"type":20,"value":21},"richtext",{"collectionId":22,"pointer":23},"5c432e6e-f7ab-4733-8a3b-ed15d8b1df6adefault","[1,[4,\"h5\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The Homepage Trap — Why General Pages Kill Paid ROAS\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"Your homepage was built to serve everyone: investors, job seekers, existing customers, and casual browsers. When a prospect clicks a specific paid ad on Meta or TikTok and lands on a generic homepage with ten navigation links, their attention fractures. Instead of buying, they click around, get distracted, and bounce—burning half your ad budget before they ever see your offer.\"]],[4,\"h5\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Message Match: The 3-Second Rule of Cold Traffic\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"When someone clicks an ad promising a specific solution, their brain looks for immediate visual and verbal confirmation on the next screen. If your ad hooks them on a specific pain point, your landing page headline must mirror that exact promise word-for-word in the first three seconds. Any cognitive disconnect between the ad creative and the page headline triggers instant distrust.\"]],[4,\"h5\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Killing the Navigation Bar to Lock In Focus\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"Dedicated conversion landing pages strip away every escape hatch. No dropdown menus, no ‘About Us’ rabbit holes, and no competing calls-to-action. Every pixel is engineered around a single binary choice: claim the offer or leave. Removing navigation leaks alone routinely lifts paid traffic conversion rates by 35% to 60%.\"]],[4,\"h5\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Why Page Speed Is a Silent Media-Buying Tax\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"Paid social traffic is overwhelmingly mobile and impatient. If your landing page takes four seconds to load heavy scripts, up to 40% of the clicks you already paid for abandon the page before the hero section even renders. That means you are paying Meta and TikTok full price for traffic that never even sees your headline.\"]]]",{"type":20,"value":25},{"collectionId":22,"pointer":26},"[1,[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"UI on Framer, Frontend on Astro: Engineered for Sub-Second Scale\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"At Enraux, we refuse to compromise between visual authority and raw speed. We architect the UI and interactive conversion flows in Framer so your brand looks like an undisputed category leader, then engineer the production frontend on Astro. The result is zero JavaScript bloat, instant mobile load times, and a frictionless path to checkout.\"]],[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Structuring the Page Like a Top 1% Sales Closer\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"A high-converting page follows a strict psychological sequence: an undeniable above-the-fold hook, agitation of the core bottleneck, a clear visual breakdown of your unique mechanism, quantified proof, and an asymmetric risk-reversal right beside the call-to-action. It anticipates and destroys every buyer objection in the exact order they arise.\"]],[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The 7-Day Landing Page Sprint Blueprint\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"You do not need an eight-week agency redesign to fix a leaky funnel. You need one ruthless, conversion-engineered landing page built specifically for your paid traffic. We scope, write, design, and ship custom high-converting landing pages in rapid 7-day sprints—starting from $900—so you can stop bleeding ad spend immediately.\"]],[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"What Happens When You Unify Ads and Pages\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"When the same team scripting your 30 monthly static ads and 3 video ads also engineers the landing page those ads point to, your acquisition metrics compound. Lower bounce rates reward you with cheaper CPMs, higher click-to-close rates slash your CAC, and your ad account can finally scale spend profitably.\"]],[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The Enraux Protocol — Closing the Loop on Your Funnel\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"Stop hiring separate ad agencies and web designers who blame each other when revenue stalls. At Enraux, we build the high-velocity ad creatives that win the click and the Astro-powered landing pages that close the sale. Launch your custom landing page sprint from $900, or start our 33-asset monthly Ad Creative Engine with just a $200 initiation deposit.\"]]]",{"type":28,"value":29},"link","https://www.instagram.com/",{"type":28,"value":31},"http://x.com/",{"type":28,"value":33},"https://www.linkedin.com/",{"type":28,"value":35},"https://www.facebook.com/","{\"from\":\"5c432e6e-f7ab-4733-8a3b-ed15d8b1df6a\",\"limit\":{\"type\":\"LiteralValue\",\"value\":3},\"offset\":{\"type\":\"LiteralValue\",\"value\":4},\"select\":[{\"collection\":\"J1qXkz06_\",\"name\":\"zwjW3YJym\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"J1qXkz06_\",\"name\":\"c7tJYtTyX\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"J1qXkz06_\",\"name\":\"aQazb_xvt\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"J1qXkz06_\",\"name\":\"LkCClLDwu\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"J1qXkz06_\",\"name\":\"J9eZvgHrx\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"J1qXkz06_\",\"name\":\"ff2p7S_0G\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"J1qXkz06_\",\"name\":\"id\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"}]}default",[38,55,71],{"zwjW3YJym":39,"c7tJYtTyX":43,"aQazb_xvt":45,"LkCClLDwu":47,"J9eZvgHrx":49,"ff2p7S_0G":51,"id":53},{"type":9,"value":40},{"src":41,"srcSet":42,"pixelWidth":13,"pixelHeight":13,"alt":14},"https://framerusercontent.com/images/9YVea6r7KWBaWG6aewUZwnjw9W8.jpg?width=1024&height=1024","https://framerusercontent.com/images/9YVea6r7KWBaWG6aewUZwnjw9W8.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1024&height=1024 512w,